            "DescriptionEN": "When party members trigger Moonglare reactions, if the equipping character is on the field, gain the Gleaming Moon: Intent effect for 4s: Increases CRIT Rate by 15%/30% when the party's Moonsign is Nascent Gleam/Ascendant Gleam. All party members' Moonglare reaction DMG is increased by 10% for each different Gleaming Moon effect that party members have. The equipping character can trigger this effect while off-field.",
